<title>USA: Indium Corp hikes price by $25 to $315 a kilo.</title>
<headline>Indium Corp hikes price by $25 to $315 a kilo.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indium Corp of America said it hike its indium price by $25 to $315 a kilogram or $9.80 a troy ounce, effective March 25.</p>
<p>This is the second price hike in March and the third since Feb 26.</p>
<p>((New York Commodity Desk 212-859-1640))</p>
